# Claude Code multi-role team harness — local orchestration, not part of the plugin.
# To version the *system* while still ignoring the transient queue state, replace the
# single line below with the three lines in the block under it.
.claude/

# .claude/team/queues/*/inbox/*.md
# .claude/team/queues/*/wip/*.md
# .claude/team/queues/*/done/*.md

